Moving into the exam module now, I need to design the database structure for handling multiple choice and essay questions while integrating with the exam integrity system we discussed earlier. I'm setting up three core tables: one for exams that references trainings and tracks time limits and violation thresholds, another for questions that stores the question type and text with ordering, and a third for the answer options tied to each question.

For tracking exam attempts, I'm creating a table that captures the user's session state, violation count, and timestamps, plus a separate table to store individual answers—either selected options for multiple choice or text responses for essays. Given the complexity, I'm scoping this to keep exams as standalone entities that optionally link to trainings, then building out the migrations, models, and controllers to handle exam creation with dynamic question management, the exam-taking interface with type toggling between multiple choice and essay, and a results view for admin grading.Lanjut ke **Bagian B — Modul Ujian** (pilihan ganda + esai + banyak soal). Ini beberapa tabel karena strukturnya emang lebih kompleks dari modul lain: ujian → punya banyak soal → tiap soal punya tipe beda → jawaban peserta dicatat terpisah.

## 1. Bikin migration untuk tabel-tabel ujian

```
php artisan make:model Exam -m
php artisan make:model ExamQuestion -m
php artisan make:model ExamOption -m
php artisan make:model ExamAttempt -m
php artisan make:model ExamAnswer -m
```

## 2. Isi tiap migration-nya

**`create_exams_table`** — ujian itu sendiri, opsional terkait ke satu Pelatihan:
```php
public function up(): void
{
    Schema::create('exams', function (Blueprint $table) {
        $table->id();
        $table->foreignId('training_id')->nullable()->constrained()->nullOnDelete();
        $table->string('title');
        $table->text('description')->nullable();
        $table->string('target_unit_kerja')->nullable();
        $table->unsignedInteger('duration_minutes')->nullable();
        $table->unsignedTinyInteger('max_violations')->default(3);
        $table->foreignId('created_by')->constrained('users')->cascadeOnDelete();
        $table->timestamps();
    });
}
```

**`create_exam_questions_table`** — soal-soal di dalam satu ujian:
```php
public function up(): void
{
    Schema::create('exam_questions', function (Blueprint $table) {
        $table->id();
        $table->foreignId('exam_id')->constrained()->cascadeOnDelete();
        $table->enum('type', ['pilihan_ganda', 'esai']);
        $table->text('question');
        $table->unsignedInteger('order')->default(0);
        $table->timestamps();
    });
}
```

**`create_exam_options_table`** — pilihan jawaban, cuma dipakai kalau tipe soalnya pilihan ganda:
```php
public function up(): void
{
    Schema::create('exam_options', function (Blueprint $table) {
        $table->id();
        $table->foreignId('exam_question_id')->constrained()->cascadeOnDelete();
        $table->string('option_text');
        $table->boolean('is_correct')->default(false);
        $table->timestamps();
    });
}
```

**`create_exam_attempts_table`** — satu baris per percobaan ujian seorang pegawai:
```php
